+Submitted and regenerated `solution.mpy` are byte-identical, both with SHA-256
+`b56ee22cbe66948fa1ea4e9dbaaf9922cfda1f8f1ddc2e5512c071fe1d8398d7`.
+`cmp -s` exited 0.
